{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"callout","kind":"caution","title":"Caution","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This class has been deprecated and will be removed in the next major version of TanStack Router.\nPlease use the "},{"type":"link","href":"./getRouteApiFunction.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"getRouteApi"}]},{"type":"text","value":" function instead."}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RouteApi"},{"type":"text","value":" class provides type-safe version of common hooks like "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useParams"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useSearch"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useRouteContext"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useNavigate"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useLoaderData"},{"type":"text","value":", and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useLoaderDeps"},{"type":"text","value":" that are pre-bound to a specific route ID and corresponding registered route types."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"constructor-options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Constructor options"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RouteApi"},{"type":"text","value":" constructor accepts a single argument: the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"options"},{"type":"text","value":" that will be used to configure the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RouteApi"},{"type":"text","value":" instance."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"opts-routeid-option","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"opts.routeId"},{"type":"text","value":" option"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Required"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The route ID to which the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RouteApi"},{"type":"text","value":" instance will be bound"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"constructor-returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Constructor returns"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"An instance of the "},{"type":"link","href":"./RouteApiType.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RouteApi"}]},{"type":"text","value":" that is pre-bound to the route ID that it was called with."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"examples","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Examples"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { RouteApi } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nconst routeApi = new RouteApi({ id: '/posts' })\n\nexport function PostsPage() {\n  const posts = routeApi.useLoaderData()\n  // ...\n}","lang":"tsx"}],"headings":[{"id":"constructor-options","text":"Constructor options","level":2},{"id":"opts-routeid-option","text":"opts.routeId option","level":3},{"id":"constructor-returns","text":"Constructor returns","level":2},{"id":"examples","text":"Examples","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n> [!CAUTION]\n> This class has been deprecated and will be removed in the next major version of TanStack Router.\n> Please use the [`getRouteApi`](./getRouteApiFunction.md) function instead.\n\nThe `RouteApi` class provides type-safe version of common hooks like `useParams`, `useSearch`, `useRouteContext`, `useNavigate`, `useLoaderData`, and `useLoaderDeps` that are pre-bound to a specific route ID and corresponding registered route types.\n\n## Constructor options\n\nThe `RouteApi` constructor accepts a single argument: the `options` that will be used to configure the `RouteApi` instance.\n\n### `opts.routeId` option\n\n- Type: `string`\n- Required\n- The route ID to which the `RouteApi` instance will be bound\n\n## Constructor returns\n\n- An instance of the [`RouteApi`](./RouteApiType.md) that is pre-bound to the route ID that it was called with.\n\n## Examples\n\n```tsx\nimport { RouteApi } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nconst routeApi = new RouteApi({ id: '/posts' })\n\nexport function PostsPage() {\n  const posts = routeApi.useLoaderData()\n  // ...\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: RouteApiClass\ntitle: RouteApi class\n---\n\n> [!CAUTION]\n> This class has been deprecated and will be removed in the next major version of TanStack Router.\n> Please use the [`getRouteApi`](./getRouteApiFunction.md) function instead.\n\nThe `RouteApi` class provides type-safe version of common hooks like `useParams`, `useSearch`, `useRouteContext`, `useNavigate`, `useLoaderData`, and `useLoaderDeps` that are pre-bound to a specific route ID and corresponding registered route types.\n\n## Constructor options\n\nThe `RouteApi` constructor accepts a single argument: the `options` that will be used to configure the `RouteApi` instance.\n\n### `opts.routeId` option\n\n- Type: `string`\n- Required\n- The route ID to which the `RouteApi` instance will be bound\n\n## Constructor returns\n\n- An instance of the [`RouteApi`](./RouteApiType.md) that is pre-bound to the route ID that it was called with.\n\n## Examples\n\n```tsx\nimport { RouteApi } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nconst routeApi = new RouteApi({ id: '/posts' })\n\nexport function PostsPage() {\n  const posts = routeApi.useLoaderData()\n  // ...\n}\n```\n"}
